; KSWorld documents, headless (doc/superpowers/specs/2026-11-06-ksworld-headless-design.md): what's being built, what it
; builds on, and what would show it works.  MARU_PLAN=ksworld notes/plan/record asks the checks; ./eval notes/plan/next.l
; with MARU_PLAN=ksworld says what's next.  The documents are third-party, so make check fetches them into a temporary
; directory (mktemp -d) before the checks that read them: a KSWorld objective never stands on documents we didn't fetch.

start-world plan.
load "notes/plan/probes.l".

set Evidence = untested | passed(tree) | failed(tree)
  | tested(tree, trials) | proved(tree, cases) | refuted(tree, counterexample) | starved(tree, met, drawn)
  | vacuous(tree) | inconclusive(tree, input).
group Good passed tested proved.

group Check Case Measure Grammar Law.
create Case evidence.
create Measure evidence command cadence.
create Grammar evidence file class rule host inherits samples.
create Law evidence file support.
qualify Case observe is it case-passes.
qualify Measure observe is it command-succeeds.
qualify Grammar observe is it compiles-and-reads.
qualify Law observe is it law-verdict.
qualify Check routine if 1 = 1.
qualify Measure routine if its cadence = "routine".

; first that the documents can be fetched; make check fetches them itself into a temporary directory before its KSWorld check
make Measure DbjrDocuments untested
  "d=$(mktemp -d \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/maru-dbjr.XXXXXX\") && notes/plan/fetch-dbjr \"$d\"; s=$?; rm -rf \"$d\"; exit $s" "routine".
make Measure KSWorldHeadless untested "nice make check CHECKS=ksworld_headless" "routine".
make Measure WholeSuite untested "nice make check" "full".

create Code tree.
action Check observed Answer consequence its evidence = Answer.
; a check's state, from every answer it has had (doc/rfc/draft-ndn-maru-john-development-00.md): union merges leave
; lanes' answers in an order no branch chose, so no state reads which came last
qualify Check holds if its evidence is Good and its evidence tree = Now tree.
qualify Check failing if not its evidence is Good and not its evidence is untested and its evidence tree = Now tree.
qualify Check regressed if it failing = yes and its evidence was Good.
qualify Check stale if not its evidence is untested and not its evidence tree = Now tree.
qualify Check untested if its evidence is untested.

create Capability what where shown-by builds-on planned.
make Capability DocumentsAvailable "the dbjr documents the checks read are fetched from tinlizzie.org/dbjr into a temporary directory"
  "notes/plan/fetch-dbjr" [ DbjrDocuments ] [ ] no.
make Capability RunsHeadless "a KSWorld document loads, every stream's code reads, and the evaluator runs it tick by tick, naming each send nothing answers"
  "ksworld-run.l, kscript.l" [ KSWorldHeadless ] [ DocumentsAvailable ] no.
make Capability NothingElseBroke "every other check in the repository still passes"
  "the whole tree" [ WholeSuite ] [ RunsHeadless ] no.

qualify Capability proven if its shown-by size > 0 and for every its shown-by do each holds = yes.
qualify Capability done if it proven = yes or it planned = yes.
qualify Capability ready if for every its builds-on do each done = yes.
rel-qualify Capability:A depends-on Capability:B if B in A builds-on.
rel-qualify Check:C supports Capability:K if C in K shown-by.

create Team.
make Team T.
action Team build Capability consequence Capability planned = yes.
rule Team build is Capability done = no.
rule Team build is Capability ready = yes.
goal Team deliver try for every all Capability do each done = yes.
goal-strategy Team deliver sat.
